     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df_Standort = pd.read_excel(excel_files[1])\n",
    "df_Standort.head()\n",
    "print(f\"Standort rows: {len(df_Standort)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6072a142",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 1. Drop Unimplemented Columns on Ingestion\n",
    "\n",
    "Five columns are structurally zero across all files because the corresponding\n",
    "sensor features were never activated. They are dropped immediately on load\n",
    "to keep the working dataframe clean. The reasons are documented here:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Reason for dropping |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `Schall (dB)` | Always 0 — sound measurement not implemented |\n",
    "| `Abstand (cm)` | Always 0 — lateral distance not implemented |\n",
    "| `Fahrspur` | Always 0 — lane indicator, not applicable on single-lane residential streets |\n",
    "| `Geschwindigkeit (km/h)` | Always 0 — point speed not implemented; actual speed is in entry/exit columns |\n",
    "| `Richtung` | Always 1 — one device per direction so this carries no information |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 112,
   "id": "eb388d86",
   "metadata": {},
