  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7e3b4f4b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 5. Duplicate Detection\n",
    "\n",
    "A true duplicate is a row where essential/meaningful field is identical — same device,\n",
    "same timestamp, same class, same speed, same length -> This might indicate a data transmission error \n",
    "(the device sent the same record twice).\n",
    "Flagged but not dropped — review before removing."
   ]
  },
